From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] setupapi: disk space list file operations and the setup source lists (2013)

setupapi: disk space list file operations and the setup source lists (2013)

SetupAddToDiskSpaceList/RemoveFromDiskSpaceList account a file's clusters
on its drive (replacing an existing file, giving back a delete, replacing
an earlier entry for the same file); SetupQueryDrivesInDiskSpaceList lists
the drives; duplicating a list copies its entries. The source lists
(SetupAddToSourceList, SetupSetSourceList, SetupQuerySourceList,
SetupFreeSourceList, SetupCancelTemporarySourceList) keep a temporary list
in the process and the user and system lists in the "Installation Sources"
value of the setup key.
